node_modules
.next
.git
*.log
# CRITICAL — the upload is the build context, so without this line ui/.env and
# ui/.env.local (NEXTAUTH_SECRET, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET) are shipped to Cloud
# Build and baked into an image layer that anyone able to pull the image can
# read, and that no later RUN can delete. Secrets must arrive at RUN time from
# the environment, never at BUILD time in a layer.
.env*
out
__pycache__
*.tsbuildinfo
*.txt
